# `package`-scoped declarations whose shape changed in 7.0.0. They appear in
# the API comparison but consumers cannot use them, so they need no migration
# note. Each line is an exact diagnostic from
# `swift package diagnose-api-breaking-changes 6.1.1`.

API breakage: constructor NetworkOperation.init(id:events:task:) has been removed
API breakage: func NetworkOperationResultGate.wait() has return type change from Swift.Result<Value, InnoNetwork.NetworkFailure> to Swift.Result<Value, InnoNetwork.NetworkError>
API breakage: func NetworkOperationResultGate.resolve(_:) has parameter 0 type change from Swift.Result<Value, InnoNetwork.NetworkFailure> to Swift.Result<Value, InnoNetwork.NetworkError>
API breakage: func DownloadFailureCoordinator.handleError(task:error:onAdmissionComplete:restart:) has parameter 2 type change from () -> Swift.Void to Foundation.Data?
API breakage: func DownloadFailureCoordinator.handleError(task:error:onAdmissionComplete:restart:) has parameter 3 type change from (InnoNetworkDownload.DownloadTask) async -> Swift.Void to () -> Swift.Void
API breakage: typealias DownloadSessionDelegateCallbacks.CompletionHandler has underlying type change from (Swift.Int, Swift.String?, Foundation.URL?, Foundation.URL?, InnoNetworkDownload.DownloadCompletionPayload?, InnoNetwork.SendableUnderlyingError?) -> Swift.Void to (Swift.Int, Swift.String?, Foundation.URL?, Foundation.URL?, InnoNetworkDownload.DownloadCompletionPayload?, InnoNetwork.SendableUnderlyingError?, Foundation.Data?) -> Swift.Void
API breakage: var DownloadURLTask.response has been added as a protocol requirement
API breakage: func DownloadFailureCoordinator.handleError(task:error:onAdmissionComplete:restart:) has been renamed to func handleError(task:error:resumeData:onAdmissionComplete:restart:)
API breakage: constructor DownloadSessionDelegate.init(callbacks:backgroundCompletionStore:completionStager:completionAdmissionGate:allowsInsecureHTTP:) has been removed
API breakage: func DownloadSessionDelegateCallbacks.handleCompletion(taskIdentifier:taskDescription:originalRequestURL:currentRequestURL:payload:error:) has been renamed to func handleCompletion(taskIdentifier:taskDescription:originalRequestURL:currentRequestURL:payload:error:resumeData:)
API breakage: func DownloadSessionDelegateCallbacks.handleCompletion(taskIdentifier:taskDescription:originalRequestURL:currentRequestURL:location:error:) has been renamed to func handleCompletion(taskIdentifier:taskDescription:originalRequestURL:currentRequestURL:location:error:resumeData:)
API breakage: constructor DownloadTransferCoordinator.init(session:runtimeRegistry:callbackDeliveryQueue:persistence:eventHub:lifecycleGate:completionStager:completionAdmissionGate:) has been removed
API breakage: constructor WebSocketConfiguration.init(maxConnectionsPerHost:connectionTimeout:heartbeatInterval:pongTimeout:maxMissedPongs:reconnectDelay:reconnectJitterRatio:maxReconnectDelay:maxReconnectAttempts:reconnectMaxTotalDuration:allowsCellularAccess:allowsInsecureWebSocket:requestHeaders:handshakeRequestAdapters:eventDeliveryPolicy:eventMetricsReporter:sendQueueLimit:sendQueueOverflowPolicy:closeHandshakeTimeout:maximumMessageSize:permessageDeflateEnabled:) has been removed
API breakage: constructor DownloadConfiguration.init(maxConnectionsPerHost:maxRetryCount:maxTotalRetries:retryDelay:exponentialBackoff:retryJitterRatio:maxRetryDelay:timeoutForRequest:timeoutForResource:taskInactivityTimeout:allowsCellularAccess:allowsInsecureHTTP:sessionIdentifier:sharedContainerIdentifier:networkMonitor:waitsForNetworkChanges:networkChangeTimeout:eventDeliveryPolicy:eventMetricsReporter:persistenceFsyncPolicy:persistenceCompactionPolicy:persistenceBaseDirectoryURL:) has been removed
API breakage: func WebSocketTask.beginReconnectWindowIfNeeded(now:) has parameter 0 type change from Foundation.Date to Swift.Duration
API breakage: var WebSocketTask.reconnectWindowStartedAt has declared type change from Foundation.Date? to Swift.Duration?
API breakage: accessor WebSocketTask.reconnectWindowStartedAt.Get() has return type change from Foundation.Date? to Swift.Duration?
API breakage: constructor WebSocketReconnectCoordinator.init(configuration:runtimeRegistry:clock:randomOffset:dateProvider:eventHub:) has been removed
API breakage: func AppendLogDownloadTaskStore.updateRetryState(id:retryCount:totalRetryCount:retryPlan:) has been renamed to func updateRetryState(id:retryCount:totalRetryCount:retryPlan:admitsResumingRecord:)
API breakage: func DownloadTaskPersistence.updateRetryState(id:retryCount:totalRetryCount:retryPlan:) has been renamed to func updateRetryState(id:retryCount:totalRetryCount:retryPlan:admitsResumingRecord:)
API breakage: func DownloadTaskStore.updateRetryState(id:retryCount:totalRetryCount:retryPlan:) has been renamed to func updateRetryState(id:retryCount:totalRetryCount:retryPlan:admitsResumingRecord:)
API breakage: func DownloadFailureCoordinator.resumePersistedRetry(task:plan:restart:) has parameter 0 type change from InnoNetworkDownload.DownloadTask to InnoNetworkDownload.DownloadRestoredRetry
API breakage: func DownloadFailureCoordinator.resumePersistedRetry(task:plan:restart:) has parameter 1 type change from InnoNetworkDownload.DownloadTaskPersistence.RetryPlan to (InnoNetworkDownload.DownloadTask) async -> Swift.Void
API breakage: func DownloadFailureCoordinator.resumePersistedRetry(task:plan:restart:) has been renamed to func resumePersistedRetry(_:restart:)
API breakage: func DownloadTaskStore.rewriteRetryPlan(id:replacing:with:retryCount:totalRetryCount:resumeData:) has been added as a protocol requirement
